  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1803.07 Homeowner ACM Disposal Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1803.07 Homeowner ACM Disposal Procedures. After submittal of the notice specified in Env-A 1803.06, the homeowner shall remove packaged ACM from the work site as soon as practical, but no later than 30 days, following the completion of the abatement work by either:\n\n(a) Delivering the ACM to a permitted disposal facility; or\n\n(b) Having the ACM picked up for disposal by a transporter.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
